  "notes": {
    "zh-CN": "用 Adoptium 官方 API 取 ZIP 与 SHA-256（API 返回的 checksum 就是 sha256）。装两份 LTS 就能演示版本切换：激活 21 后 java -version 就是 21。",
    "en-US": "ZIP and SHA-256 come from the official Adoptium API. Installing two LTS releases demonstrates version switching: activate 21 and java -version reports 21."
